{"ID":"20230926153928-p5db79z","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926153928-p5db79z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153928-p5db79z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153930-xtvxltd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153930-ize7wm6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153930-ize7wm6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:25,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:25\u0026#125;","title":"【文蛤汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926153930"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926153930-xtvxltd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153930-xtvxltd","updated":"20230926153930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：文蛤五两、麻黄三两、甘草三两、生姜三两、石膏五两、杏仁五十枚、大枣十二枚"}]},{"ID":"20230926153930-0c6nwb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153930-0c6nwb6","updated":"20230926153930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右七味，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，温服一升，汗出即愈。若不汗，再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926153930-ize7wm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153930-ize7wm6","updated":"20230926153930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【桂林本】消渴，欲得水，而食饮不休者，文蛤汤主之。"}]}]}